flowchart LR
  gw[Gateway] --> auth[Auth] & users[Users] & orders[Orders] & pay[Payments] & search[Search] & notif[Notify]
  subgraph Data [Data layer]
    direction TB
    pg[(Postgres)]
    redis[(Redis)]
    es[(Elastic)]
    kafka[[Kafka]]
  end
  auth --> pg & redis
  users --> pg & redis & es
  orders --> pg & kafka
  pay --> pg & kafka
  search --> es & redis
  notif --> kafka & redis
  gw -.-> Data
  kafka --> notif
